{"schemaVersion":1,"articles":[{"id":"monsters.monster.human.statblock.human-trickshot","title":"Человек-трюковой стрелок","chapter":"23. Бестиарий","group":"Люди","path":"Monsters/monster/human/statblock/human-trickshot.md","originalId":"mcdm.monsters.v1/monster.human.statblock/human-trickshot","originalName":"Human Trickshot","originalDescription":"|             Human, Humanoid             |         -         |      Level 1      |   Platoon Artillery   |         EV 6         |\n|:---------------------------------------:|:-----------------:|:-----------------:|:---------------------:|:--------------------:|\n|             **1M**<br>Size              |  **5**<br>Speed   | **20**<br>Stamina |  **0**<br>Stability   | **4**<br>Free Strike |\n| **Corruption 1, psychic 1**<br>Immunity | **-**<br>Movement |         -         | **-**<br>With Captain |  **-**<br>Weakness   |\n|             **0**<br>Might              | **+2**<br>Agility |  **0**<br>Reason  |  **+1**<br>Intuition  |  **0**<br>Presence   |\n\n> ⚔️ **Trick Crossbow (Signature Ability)**\n>\n> | **Melee, Ranged, Strike, Weapon** |               **[Main action](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.combat/turn)** |\n> |-----------------------------------|------------------------------:|\n> | **📏 Melee 1 or ranged 15**       | **🎯 One creature or object** |\n>\n> **Power Roll + 2:**\n>\n> - **≤11:** 6 damage\n> - **12-16:** 9 damage\n> - **17+:** 12 damage\n>\n> **Effect:** This ability ignores cover and concealment.\n>\n> **3 Malice:** This ability targets one additional target.\n\n> ⭐️ **Supernatural Insight**\n>\n> The trickshot ignores concealment if it's granted by a supernatural effect.","director":{"section":"monsters","sourcePath":"monster/human/statblock/human-trickshot.json","sourceRevision":"bdb12093b1d07bf8674453796eac907a09dd7dd3","groupSlug":"human","recordType":"statblock","level":1,"ev":"6","size":"1M","keywords":["Человек","Гуманоид"],"role":"Артиллерист","organization":"Взвод"},"blocks":[{"type":"entity","ref":"monster.human.statblock.human-trickshot"},{"type":"entity","ref":"monster.human.human-malice"}],"related":[{"id":"monsters.monster.group.human","title":"Люди"},{"id":"monsters.monster.human.human-malice","title":"Раздор людей"},{"id":"monsters.rule.monster.malice","title":"Раздор"}],"originalCoverage":{"status":"complete"}}],"entities":[{"id":"monster.human.statblock.human-trickshot","kind":"monster","name":"Человек-трюковой стрелок","markdown":"| Человек, Гуманоид | - | Уровень 1 | Взвод, Артиллерист | Боевая ценность 6 |\n|:-----------------:|:---:|:---------:|:----------------:|:----------------------:|\n| **1M**<br>Размер | **5**<br>Скорость | **20**<br>Выносливость | **0**<br>Устойчивость | **4**<br>Свободный удар |\n| **Порча 1, Психический 1**<br>Иммунитет | **-**<br>Движение | - | **-**<br>С капитаном | **-**<br>Уязвимость |\n| **0**<br>Мощь | **+2**<br>Ловкость | **0**<br>Разум | **+1**<br>Интуиция | **0**<br>Присутствие |\n\n> ⚔️ **Трюковой арбалет (Знаковая способность)**\n>\n> | **Ближний, Дальний, Удар, Оружие** | **[Основное действие](#/catalog/glossary#term-glossary.turn)** |\n> |------------------------------------|------------------------------:|\n> | **📏 Ближний 1 или Дальний 15** | **🎯 Одно существо или объект** |\n>\n> **Бросок силы + 2:**\n>\n> - **≤11:** 6 урона\n> - **12-16:** 9 урона\n> - **17+:** 12 урона\n>\n> **Эффект:** эта способность игнорирует укрытие и сокрытие.\n>\n> **3 Раздора:** эта способность нацеливается ещё на одну цель.\n\n> ⭐️ **Сверхъестественная проницательность**\n>\n> Стрелок-трюкач игнорирует сокрытие, если оно вызвано сверхъестественным эффектом.\n","source":{"articleId":"monsters.monster.human.statblock.human-trickshot","path":"Monsters/monster/human/statblock/human-trickshot.md"},"originalId":"mcdm.monsters.v1/monster.human.statblock/human-trickshot","originalName":"Human Trickshot","originalDescription":"|             Human, Humanoid             |         -         |      Level 1      |   Platoon Artillery   |         EV 6         |\n|:---------------------------------------:|:-----------------:|:-----------------:|:---------------------:|:--------------------:|\n|             **1M**<br>Size              |  **5**<br>Speed   | **20**<br>Stamina |  **0**<br>Stability   | **4**<br>Free Strike |\n| **Corruption 1, psychic 1**<br>Immunity | **-**<br>Movement |         -         | **-**<br>With Captain |  **-**<br>Weakness   |\n|             **0**<br>Might              | **+2**<br>Agility |  **0**<br>Reason  |  **+1**<br>Intuition  |  **0**<br>Presence   |\n\n> ⚔️ **Trick Crossbow (Signature Ability)**\n>\n> | **Melee, Ranged, Strike, Weapon** |               **[Main action](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.combat/turn)** |\n> |-----------------------------------|------------------------------:|\n> | **📏 Melee 1 or ranged 15**       | **🎯 One creature or object** |\n>\n> **Power Roll + 2:**\n>\n> - **≤11:** 6 damage\n> - **12-16:** 9 damage\n> - **17+:** 12 damage\n>\n> **Effect:** This ability ignores cover and concealment.\n>\n> **3 Malice:** This ability targets one additional target.\n\n> ⭐️ **Supernatural Insight**\n>\n> The trickshot ignores concealment if it's granted by a supernatural effect.","director":{"section":"monsters","sourcePath":"monster/human/statblock/human-trickshot.json","sourceRevision":"bdb12093b1d07bf8674453796eac907a09dd7dd3","groupSlug":"human","recordType":"statblock","level":1,"ev":"6","size":"1M","keywords":["Человек","Гуманоид"],"role":"Артиллерист","organization":"Взвод"},"originalCoverage":{"status":"complete"},"printedCreature":{"ru":[0,[[6,[[2,["Человек, Гуманоид"],{"data":{"$":{"s":"keywords"}}}],[2,["Уровень 1"],{"data":{"$":{"s":"level"}}}],[2,["Взвод, Артиллерист"],{"data":{"$":{"s":"organization"}}}],[2,["Боевая ценность 6"],{"data":{"$":{"s":"ev"}}}],[6,[[2,[[3,["1M"]]],{"data":{"$":{"s":"value"}}}],[2,["Размер"],{"data":{"$":{"s":"label"}}}]],{"data":{"$":{"s":"stat","p":{"data-director-field":"size"}}}}],[6,[[2,[[3,["5"]]],{"data":{"$":{"s"